{title: Tere Bina Zindagi Se Koi}
{artist: Aandhi 1975 Kishore Kumar Lata Mangeshkar R D Burman Gulzar}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Tere bina [D#]zindagi se koi
[D#]shikwa [G#]to nahin [Fm]Shikwa nahin,
[A#]shikwa nahin, [Cm]shikwa nahin
[Cm]Tere bina [D#]zindagi bhi lekin
[D#]zindagi [G#]to nahin [Fm]Zindagi nahin,
[A#]zindagi nahin, [Cm]zindagi nahin
[Cm]Kaash [G]aisa ho
[G#]tere [D#]kadmon se
[F]chun ke manzil chale
[A#]Aur kahin [Cm]door kahin
[A#]Tum gar saath ho,
[F]manzilon ki [Cm]kami to nahin
[Cm]Jee mein [G]aata hai
[G#]tere [D#]daaman mein
[F]Sar chhupa ke hum
[A#]rote rahein, [Cm]rote rahein
[A#]Teri bhi aankhon mein
[F]aansuon ki [Cm]nami to nahin
[Cm]Tum jo [G]keh do to
[G#]aaj [D#]ki raat
[F]chaand doobega nahin
[A#]Raat ko [Cm]rok lo
[A#]Raat ki baat hai
[F]aur zindagi [Cm]baaki to nahin
